<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0684_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wade</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You hard! I fw you!\nI look for homies here every day.\rWhen I’m in the tall grass, I find all\nkinds of Berries.\rIf you want, I’ll share some.\nCan I get your number? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You gon’ hear from me as soon as I\nfind somethin’ you might like.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh well.\rDon’t be shy if you want my\nnumber.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When I’m in the tall grass, I find all\nkinds of Berries.\rIf you want, I’ll share some.\nCan I get your number? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Good to see you!\nSee? This what I found.\fIt’s yours!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You right nearby, ain’t you?\nThen just come talk in person!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your homies growin’?\rMine growin’ a lil TOO\nfast for me. It’s a lot!\r{STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} growin’ extra\nfast. I think it’s gon’ get tough.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah, we knocked out a wild\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} with one hit a while back.\rIt went down so easy, I felt\nkinda bad for it.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh yeah, a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} got\naway from me at the last second.\rI know it’s a common homie...\rBut it still bug me that it dipped\nwhen I almost had it.\rLater!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You feel like a scrap?\nIt ain’t gon’ be like last time!\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} is where I’ll be.\nLmk when you get there.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s scrap already!\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} is where I’m at.\nGet here ASAP!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? Berries?\rMy bad, I ain’t found none yet.\nI’ll call you if I find some.\fCan you wait?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I found all kinds of Berries. If you\nwant, I’ll share some with you.\rI’ll be waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">How come you ain’t here yet?\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} is where I’m at.\nGet here ASAP!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Bug-Catching Contest at the\nNational Park today.\fYou goin’, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rI’m still decidin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0684_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Bug-Catching Contest at the\nNational Park today.\fYou goin’, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rI’m still decidin’.</language>
	</row>
</body>
